# Form fields (Bnood)

## Labels and hints

- **Label** stays on **`CustomTextField`** default in-border floating behavior (resting when empty, floated on focus/value). Do not change label position unless the owner requests it.
- **Placeholder** (`placeholder:`): short **example or format** from `l10n` only — never English in AR UI, never duplicate the label as placeholder.
- **Error**: field validator message; server failures → toast only.

## Sizing

- Default single-line height: `AppSize.fieldHeight` (48).
- Opt-in taller fields: `fieldHeight: AppSize.fieldHeightComfortable` (52) — frame grows with token padding; avoid magic heights that clip text at large accessibility scale.

## Phone and digits

- Western digits in hints and display (`bnood-western-digits.mdc`).
- Egypt mobile fields: `AppInputType.phone`, `ltrValue: true`, localized format hint, `AutofillHints.telephoneNumber`.

## Keyboard

- Set `textInputAction` (`next` / `done`) on multi-field sheets explicitly when order matters.
